1. Introduction

The Project Documentation Phase is the stage where all information related to the LegalEase project is organized and presented in a clear and systematic manner.

Documentation explains the purpose, requirements, design, development, testing, results, limitations, and future scope of the project. It also provides a reference for users, developers, teachers, and evaluators.

LegalEase is an AI-powered web application designed to help users create AI-assisted legal document drafts by entering required information and selecting a suitable document type.

> LegalEase is a drafting-assistance system. Its generated content should be reviewed and does not replace professional legal advice.




