5. Abstract

Abstract

LegalEase is an AI-powered web application designed to simplify the process of preparing basic legal document drafts. Traditional document preparation can be time-consuming and difficult for users who are unfamiliar with legal terminology and document structures.

The proposed system allows users to select a document type and enter relevant information through a simple interface. The application processes the information using an AI service and generates a structured document draft. Users can preview, edit, regenerate, and download the generated document.

The system combines web technologies, backend processing, artificial intelligence, and document generation to provide a convenient drafting assistant. Appropriate disclaimers and user-review steps are included because AI-generated content may require verification and does not constitute professional legal advice.


